=== Benchmark Methodology
<testing--maintenance-benchmark-methodology>
1. Create a stable reference save with fixed weather (`fw 10a240`), fixed time (`set gamehour to 12`), `tfc 1` for reproducible screenshots. Save as `benchmark\_ref.ess`.
2. Use fixed routes — same save, same path for 60 seconds.
3. Log everything via MSI Afterburner or NVIDIA FrameView CSV.
4. Test one change at a time.

